{"lang": "zh_TW", "eventid": "act49side", "eventName": "辭歲行", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "TA-2", "avgTag": "行動前", "storyName": "大頭鬼", "storyInfo": "歲將望困入記憶的囚籠：餘降世後，諸位歲獸代理人身邊的怪事不斷，種種異象皆指向歲的甦醒。頡向望展示書刀的威能，她正積極尋求除歲的方法。\n", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 0.0, "fillfrom": 0.1, "fillto": 0.2, "fadetime": 0.1}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 4.0, "fillfrom": 0.1, "fillto": 0.2, "fadetime": 0.1}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "70_g7_suilingcore", "x": 0.0, "xScale": 1.2, "yScale": 1.2, "fadetime": 5.0}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.4, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$m_sys_act14mini_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "你來了。", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "還是這一局棋……千年來，你已經輸了無數次的棋局。", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "你妄圖以分身對抗整體……這些苦心孤詣的謀劃，在我看來，不過是頑童遊戲。", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "沉溺於兒戲之中，正是你一如既往的惡習。", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "你這一次挑戰，也不過是對以往千萬遍慘敗的重複。", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "subtitle", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……呵。"}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你還在用傲慢遮掩你的恐懼。"}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "何必徒勞？"}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "憤怒、害怕、期待……你想在我身上看見的東西，我在你身上一覽無遺。"}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果你不害怕，那便入局。"}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這一次……"}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "輸的一定是你。"}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 3.0}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 26, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_weiqi_heavy"}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 31, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "70_g11_oldpavilion", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這一局，是我輸了。", "name": "朔"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 36, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 38, "prop": "animtext", "attributes": {"content": "<p=1>593年</>", "id": "at1", "name": "group_location_stamp", "style": "avg_only_heavy", "pos": "-400,-200", "block": "false", "p": 1.0}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "animtextclean", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$m_sys_act23side_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#6$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒想到這邊對殺還有這一種變化……真是失算了。", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#6$1"}, {"id": 46, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#2$2", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……百手左右，要不是你在腹地一味退讓求和，說不定還有爭勝可能。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#2$2"}, {"id": 51, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "原來如此……那時算不清後續變化，就只能選了最穩妥的下法。     ", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#10$1"}, {"id": 53, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哈哈，我還以為最近在棋藝上有些長進，看來還是差你許多。", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#10$1"}, {"id": 54, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "最近這一戰，多虧你以逸待勞、誘敵深入的計策，我軍才得以避免許多傷亡。", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#10$1"}, {"id": 56, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你這次回京可以好好歇息一陣，只是下次再見，恐怕又得是許久之後了。", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#10$1"}, {"id": 57, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#2$2"}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你倒是一點都沒有把勝負放在心上。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#2$2"}, {"id": 59, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "兄弟相處，又不是廟算勝負，何必這麼計較。", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#10$1"}, {"id": 61, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#4$2"}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不光是下棋，我看你不管在哪裡都樂意當個宅心仁厚的老好人，什麼事都可以不放在心上。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#4$2"}, {"id": 63, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#6$1"}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這又是從何說起……", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#6$1"}, {"id": 65, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "兩月前，新上任的兵部右侍郎連同禮部共參了你一本。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}, {"id": 67, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "擁兵獨斷，不是小罪名。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}, {"id": 68, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"}, {"id": 70, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "近半年來你我一直同在前線，你如何能得知朝中的事？", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"}, {"id": 71, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#3$2"}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我自有辦法，你應該擔心的是你自己。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#3$2"}, {"id": 73, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果他說的是之前我帶兵不曾按時回營的事，那是因為行軍途中突遇天災，不得不另外紮營。", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"}, {"id": 75, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這件事楊將軍當時便已經知曉，就算兵部追責起來，也當有公論。", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"}, {"id": 76, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "倒不是讓你擔心這一件事。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}, {"id": 78, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那位侍郎被查出收受賄賂，手伸到了軍需用度上……此時應該正在獄中候審。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}, {"id": 79, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "暫時不會再任他謠言惑眾，至於能不能活著從獄裡出來，就要看他的運氣了。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}, {"id": 80, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1"}, {"id": 82, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你答應過我，不會再染指朝堂政事。", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1"}, {"id": 83, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#3$2"}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "明明是幫大炎除去了一個不乾淨的官員，怎麼還反過來指責我多管閒事？", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#3$2"}, {"id": 85, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你很清楚自己到底是什麼用心……", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1"}, {"id": 87, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你是覺得整個朝堂都是你的棋局，別人的性命都是你的掌上玩物？", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1"}, {"id": 88, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$2"}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……呵，你願意當正人君子，難道你就看不到有多少人用心險惡？", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$2"}, {"id": 90, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那人剛上任就敢將矛頭指向你，難道背後沒有他人指使？想要與我們為敵的豈止一人？", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$2"}, {"id": 91, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對這一人手軟，後患無窮。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$2"}, {"id": 92, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#9$1"}, {"id": 94, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "從么弟誕生以來，我們周遭發生了多少怪事。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}, {"id": 96, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#4$2"}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……方的病人明明見好，卻莫名其妙地投了井。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#4$2"}, {"id": 98, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "有人模仿夕的筆觸，藉她的名頭畫了不少顛倒黑白的“諷喻之作”。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#4$2"}, {"id": 99, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "易的園子進了盜匪，丟失了幾件重要的藏物。大理寺嚴加審問，到最後發現只是一夥不折不扣的笨賊。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#4$2"}, {"id": 100, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "然後，就是關於你的事。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}, {"id": 102, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"}, {"id": 104, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我們都清楚……祂還未死。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}, {"id": 106, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這裡的人們從未忘記祂是何等恐怖之物，直到現在，我們的一舉一動、每一次見面，都會被嚴加監管。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}, {"id": 107, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "難道你還認為，靠你立下的一星半點的功績，就可以讓人不把我們當作其心可誅的異類？", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}, {"id": 108, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "方弟和夕妹……都還好嗎？", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"}, {"id": 110, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "方的確消沉了一陣子，夕從來都是如此，不過想必他們都不至於太放在心上。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}, {"id": 112, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "問題在於，今後又該如何？", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}, {"id": 113, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你認為，這一切背後都有人在操縱？", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"}, {"id": 115, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是山海眾？還是其他人別有用心？", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"}, {"id": 116, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$2"}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……這才是我擔心的。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$2"}, {"id": 118, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果這些事背後都有一個統一的指使者……", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$2"}, {"id": 119, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我算不到此人會是誰，更不知道他的意圖如何。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$2"}, {"id": 120, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你說的這些事，我會找司歲台一一核實。", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"}, {"id": 122, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我知道你是好心。", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"}, {"id": 123, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "下次別再行這種踰矩之事。", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"}, {"id": 124, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我們之間何曾是彼此擔憂的關係？", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}, {"id": 126, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我只是不想遭人陷害還一無所知。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}, {"id": 127, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#10$2"}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "時候差不多了，該走了。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#10$2"}, {"id": 129, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "路途遙遠，路上多加小心。", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"}, {"id": 131, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "回京後，代我問候他們吧。", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1"}, {"id": 132, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我未必會去見他們。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}, {"id": 134, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉。", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#3$1"}, {"id": 141, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 144, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "代理人於是辭別手足同胞，朝京城的方向走去。"}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "路途遙遠，他走得很急，沒時間為了路上聽見的一絲雜音駐足。"}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 151, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一招不慎……", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "滿盤皆輸……", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那，我們就從餘開始，怎麼樣？"}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好啊。餘……我想想……"}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "餘音繞梁。"}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "70_g12_oldyanroom", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$suifamilybond_intro", "key": "$suifamilybond_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 164, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#4$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "梁、梁……", "name": "餘"}, "figure_art": "avg_2026_yu_1#4$1"}, {"id": 167, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "餘"}, "figure_art": "avg_2026_yu_1#3$1"}, {"id": 169, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "三姐，梁……梁字能接什麼成語啊？", "name": "餘"}, "figure_art": "avg_2026_yu_1#1$1"}, {"id": 171, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "該不會剛一開始就要認輸了吧？", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}, {"id": 176, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怎、怎麼會，我就是忙著處理獸肉，沒功夫想。再給我一點時間嘛。", "name": "餘"}, "figure_art": "avg_2026_yu_1#9$1"}, {"id": 178, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好，好……我還有很多書要抄，你慢慢想，不著急。", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#8$1"}, {"id": 180, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "梁……感覺應該去抓四哥問問，但是四哥又不在……", "name": "餘"}, "figure_art": "avg_2026_yu_1#4$1"}, {"id": 182, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#20$1"}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "餘", "content": "橫梁、房梁、棟梁——棟梁之材！"}}, {"id": 184, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#19$1"}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "餘", "content": "不對，梁字應該在第一個……"}}, {"id": 186, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#17$1"}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（對了，三姐手邊有那麼多寫字的竹簡，偷偷看一眼，說不定……）", "name": "餘"}, "figure_art": "avg_2026_yu_1#17$1"}, {"id": 188, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 189, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "小餘？怎麼了？", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}, {"id": 190, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "——沒事沒事！", "name": "餘"}, "figure_art": "avg_2026_yu_1#10$1"}, {"id": 192, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對了，三姐。你為什麼要把這些竹簡上的字，全部抄到這些方片上呢？", "name": "餘"}, "figure_art": "avg_2026_yu_1#8$1"}, {"id": 194, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這是最近人們的新發明，叫“紙”。", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}, {"id": 196, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你看，它比竹簡輕便，寫起字來更容易，還不會輕易生蟲腐化，更方便保存呢。", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}, {"id": 197, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "寫在“紙”上的東西，就能永遠保存下來？", "name": "餘"}, "figure_art": "avg_2026_yu_1#8$1"}, {"id": 199, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是，也不全是。", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}, {"id": 201, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "寫在竹簡上的東西或許可以完整留存幾十年，寫在紙上的文字，也許能保存數百年。", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}, {"id": 202, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但竹簡也好紙張也罷，總有腐化的一天。", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#4$1"}, {"id": 204, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "無論用什麼東西去記載，只有記下來的東西，真正被人們記住了，那才能永遠地留存下去。", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#4$1"}, {"id": 205, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就像小餘煮的菜一樣，人們嚐過了，也會永遠記住的。", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}, {"id": 207, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#14$1"}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯……", "name": "餘"}, "figure_art": "avg_2026_yu_1#14$1"}, {"id": 209, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "男孩似懂非懂地聽著，坐在剛處理好的整隻牧獸旁邊抓耳撓腮，怎麼也想不出那個“梁”開頭的成語。"}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一枚從竹簡上削下來，帶著一小段話的薄片忽然落在他面前。"}}, {"id": 212, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#21$1"}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "梁上君子！", "name": "餘"}, "figure_art": "avg_2026_yu_1#21$1"}, {"id": 214, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不錯不錯，“梁上君子”。讓我想想，子字該接的是……子虛——", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}, {"id": 216, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#19$1"}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不、不玩了，還是等下次大姐和夕姐在的時候我看你們玩吧。這個“接龍”的遊戲好難啊。", "name": "餘"}, "figure_art": "avg_2026_yu_1#19$1"}, {"id": 218, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "三姐，你餓不餓？要不然我做點什麼吃的？", "name": "餘"}, "figure_art": "avg_2026_yu_1#5$1"}, {"id": 220, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好啊。", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}, {"id": 222, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這些竹簡要是不用了，能不能也給我？", "name": "餘"}, "figure_art": "avg_2026_yu_1#1$1"}, {"id": 224, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "要拿來生火嗎？可以是可以……", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#3$1"}, {"id": 226, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "70_i01_2", "xScale": 1.1, "yScale": 1.1, "screenadapt": "coverall", "fadetime": 0.0}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 232, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "年幼的代理人從姐姐手裡接過竹簡，熟練地從中間剖開……"}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_scrapebamboo", "channel": "1"}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_scrapebamboo", "channel": "2", "delay": 1.0}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "削成一根一根的竹籤。"}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這是要做……？", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "烤肉串！", "name": "餘"}}, {"id": 238, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這頭牧獸的里脊肥瘦正好，肚子上的肥肉也很厚實，拿來做成烤肉肯定好吃。", "name": "餘"}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "至於燒火的材料，還得用木炭。這些竹簡燒不久的。", "name": "餘"}}, {"id": 240, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "木炭我早就備好了，等削好竹籤、串完肉串，就可以開始烤肉了。", "name": "餘"}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哈哈……這是不是也算人們說的“吃墨水”？", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 242, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嘿嘿，那這道菜就叫“墨水烤肉”！", "name": "餘"}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "小餘的手藝總不會錯，我就等著大飽口福啦。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 244, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "喏，正好這些竹簡也抄好了，你都拿去吧。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……你們都在。", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 248, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 250, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "70_i01_1", "xScale": 1.1, "yScale": 1.1, "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 252, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊……你回來了？", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 255, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "70_i01_3", "xScale": 1.1, "yScale": 1.1, "screenadapt": "coverall", "fadetime": 0.5}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"xScaleFrom": 1.1, "yScaleFrom": 1.1, "xScaleTo": 1.0, "yScaleTo": 1.0, "duration": 35.0}}, {"id": 257, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "欸……？", "name": "餘"}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "二……二哥？", "name": "餘"}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 260, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "之前收到了信，我還以為你要過幾天才能到呢。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 261, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "路上還順利？", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你們……", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 264, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只聽說過有人焚琴煮羽，已經是糟蹋敗壞至極。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這是在拿書簡做什麼？", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 266, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我……不是……", "name": "餘"}}, {"id": 267, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這是……三姐給我的……", "name": "餘"}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 270, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "70_g12_oldyanroom", "screenadapt": "coverall", "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 275, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 276, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "100,0", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 277, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 278, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 279, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "看到從屋外走進來的男人，男孩怯生生地躲在姐姐的身後，只露出半個腦袋。"}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 281, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只是一些壞了的竹簡，就交給小餘物盡其用了。你兇什麼？", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#10$1"}, {"id": 282, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "小餘好心準備晚飯，你還不領情？", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#10$1"}, {"id": 283, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#4$2"}}, {"id": 285, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我也沒說什麼……", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#10$1"}, {"id": 286, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 287, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "二哥三姐……！你們別吵架！", "name": "餘"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#10$1"}, {"id": 288, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 289, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我先去準備晚飯！二哥好不容易回來一趟，今天我們終於能一起吃晚飯啦！", "name": "餘"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#10$1"}, {"id": 290, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 291, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你……你們先聊！", "name": "餘"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#10$1"}, {"id": 292, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 293, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$rungeneral", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs"}}, {"id": 294, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 1.5}}, {"id": 295, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 0.8, "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "200,0"}}, {"id": 296, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 297, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 298, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#10$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 300, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉……", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 302, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他本來就有些怕你，你就不能稍微溫柔一點？", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 303, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#4$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 304, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 305, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#11$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 306, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "事情不順利？", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 308, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 309, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 310, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我明白了……", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 311, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 312, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過我們一家人難得能聚一次，小餘也總惦記著你。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 313, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "有什麼事，等吃完飯再說，好嗎？", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 314, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 315, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 316, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 317, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 318, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 319, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 320, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 321, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_indoor", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 322, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 323, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 324, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$ponder_intro", "key": "$ponder_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 325, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 326, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "原來在我不知道的地方，還發生了這麼多令人不安的事。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 327, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 328, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你看起來倒一點也不擔憂。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 329, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 330, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "當然還是會擔憂的，我只是有些驚訝……原來二哥也會這樣關心我們兄弟姐妹。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 331, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只是誕生於同一個破碎的意識，與所謂的血親哪有半分相似。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 333, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#4$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "各自志趣有別，生死無關，終究是……道不相同。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 335, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#11$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 336, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "二哥當真是這樣想的？", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 337, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#4$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 338, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 339, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 340, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我的想法倒是不一樣。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 341, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你看，我們來到這世上已有數百年，就算無法完全融入其中，所見的那些風景人物，大多是可愛的。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 342, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 343, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可是每每遇到可以交談相識的人，彷彿只是須臾一瞬，就已經變成過往雲煙。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 344, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "到最後，留在身邊的，還能說些真心話的人，還是只有“我們”……", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 345, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 346, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就算有些矛盾、性格脾氣有不合的地方，但無論如何也無法割捨……這樣的關係，難道不是像極了人世間的兄弟姐妹？", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 347, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#10$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 348, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……你願意這樣想，我也無意辯駁。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 349, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 350, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉……真不知道你為什麼總是這副拒人千里之外的樣子。我們好不容易能見一次面，難道一點都不開心？", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 351, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "要是哪一天，哪個弟弟妹妹突然消失，你再也見不到了，我倒要看看你會不會後悔。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 352, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 353, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 354, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 355, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對了，二哥既然說到這些事，不久前，我也遇上了一件怪事。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 356, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 357, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "有一天夜裡，我正準備睡覺，突然聽見書房裡有響動。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 358, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我在院中，隔著窗戶彷彿看到一個人影正伏在案上，似乎在寫些什麼東西。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 359, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 360, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我連忙趕了進去，沒看到什麼人，只看到了幾天前我謄寫的那本《急就章》攤開放在書桌上。不知道被什麼人塗畫成了這個樣子……", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 361, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 362, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "頡說著，從書桌上找出了那本書帖。"}}, {"id": 363, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_paper2", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 364, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "書上每個筆跡工整的文字上，都覆寫上了同一個字。"}}, {"id": 365, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 366, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.6, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 367, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "multi": "true", "text": "<color=#d70000>歲</color>", "x": 330.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 28.0, "delay": 0.0, "width": 700.0, "block": "true", "duration": 2.0}}, {"id": 368, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1"}}, {"id": 369, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 370, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 20.0, "ystrength": 20.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 371, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 372, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#12$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 373, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "——！", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 374, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 375, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "二哥……你覺得這究竟會是何人所為？", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 376, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 377, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……只可能是祂。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 378, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "祂在甦醒，祂正在透過某種方式干涉我們。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 379, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在餘降世後，我們原本都以為祂的神識應當已經被消磨殆盡。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 380, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但祂還活著……祂現在還在沉睡，卻成了我們每個人的夢魘。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 381, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果有朝一日祂醒來，那我們則會變成祂浮光泡影的夢……", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 382, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 383, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "關於此事，二哥有什麼主意？", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 384, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 385, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我暫時還不知道，但我會想辦法……", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 386, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 387, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那要不要聽一聽，我的主意？", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 388, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 389, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "其實我也是直到最近才想到……起因是我發現，我和炎國的人們一同編撰史書的時候，無論多麼小心，總還是會有犯錯的時候。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 390, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不同於尋常文章，寫在史書上的錯，想要去刪改修正，都要花費不少功夫。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 391, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 392, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_scrapebook_quick", "volume": 0.5}}, {"id": 393, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "說著，頡拿起書桌上一柄用於削竹簡的書刀，又隨手拾起一卷書，用書刀在紙上輕輕一刮。"}}, {"id": 394, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "深深沁入紙張，甚至有少許湮在了下一頁上的墨跡，隨著書刀和紙頁的接觸消逝無蹤，紙面重新變得光潔如新。"}}, {"id": 395, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 396, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這書刀……", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 397, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 398, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大概是沾染了一些我的氣息，變得有些不尋常了。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 399, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 400, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我隱隱有種感覺，它刮去的文字——一段歷史，或者，也許至少……一個名字——不僅會消失在紙上，也會從人們心中被抹除。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 401, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我在想，或許終有一天，我們可以用它，從世上的所有文字中，抹去“歲”這個字呢？", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 402, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#6$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 403, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你能夠做到……這種事？", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 404, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 405, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "現在還不能。現在它只是一把有點神奇之處的書刀。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 406, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 407, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但是我能感覺得到，記述的文字越多，我手中的刀和筆，便越有分量。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 408, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "也許我們都一樣，我們從那片混沌鴻蒙中找到了“我是誰”的答案，又在這人世間明確了自己存在的意義，這正是我們有別於祂的證明。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 409, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 410, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "也許有朝一日，我們擁有的力量會超越祂，到那時，我們就能夠擺脫祂的影響，真正作為“我們”而活著。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 411, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "當然前提是，我們絕對不可以忘了自己是誰。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 412, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#4$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 413, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 414, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 415, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "二哥？你又在一個人想什麼呢？", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 416, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 417, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不……不必在意。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 418, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 419, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉……有時候我在想，或許兄弟姐妹當中，我和你的脾氣應該是最不合的。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 420, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "算計籌謀，都是要藏在心裡的東西，但是文字語言，卻是要把心中所想傳達出來……", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 421, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但有時候我偏偏又覺得，你對我明明毫無隱瞞。你心裡想的，我都能看到。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 422, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#3$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 423, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我對你…… ", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 424, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 425, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "想來也真有趣，我們各自在這世上找到了一樣盡心鑽研的事物，結果像是反過來被改變了個性一樣。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 426, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "黍常常說我總是沉溺於過去，我也記得她說過的，在未來盡頭看到的那一片雪白的死寂。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 427, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她說得也沒錯，心裡有放不下的事，終究是沒辦法強裝豁達的。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 428, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我知道，二哥始終在擔憂那個不可知的將來……你最在意勝負，但若只有勝負，這種活法未免也太乾癟枯瘦了些。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 429, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "二哥，在勝負之外，你牽掛的到底是什麼呢？", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 430, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 431, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "並非牽掛勝負，只是……", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 432, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只是對必敗的棋局，心有不甘。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 433, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 434, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯……", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 435, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 436, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對了，你明天不是要回司歲台述職？那我抄好的這些書，就麻煩二哥順路幫我送去了。進天鏡閣前，這些書他們還要再過一遍。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 437, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 438, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……好。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 439, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 440, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "還有，那卷重新抄過的《急就章》，麻煩二哥交之前再幫我仔細看看吧。書刀也給你，免得有錯字不好改。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 441, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#2$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 442, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你經手的文章，哪裡用得到我來核查。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 443, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 444, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就當作是你最近閒時的消遣，隨便看看嘛。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 445, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "二哥常年為戰事籌謀，心裡都被勝負得失占滿了。不如做點別的事，換換心情？", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 446, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 447, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而且，說不定能在文章裡發現你在找的東西呢？  ", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 448, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 449, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 450, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 451, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 452, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 453, "prop": "hidecgitem", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 454, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 455, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 456, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": ""}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}